# Snaplink URL Shortener

A full-stack URL shortening service with analytics tracking, built with Spring Boot and React.

---

## Features

- Shorten long URLs into compact, shareable links
- Track click analytics (IP, user agent, timestamp)
- User authentication with session management
- Per-link analytics toggle


## Database Schema

![Database Schema](./docs/images/schema.svg)

### Tables

| Table | Description |
|---|---|
| `auth` | Stores user credentials (email, password) |
| `users` | Stores user profile information |
| `AuthSession` | Manages active user sessions and tokens |
| `UrlMapping` | Maps short codes to original URLs |
| `Analytics` | Tracks click events per short URL |




